1
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:04,937
Swing that,

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,019
and the Qians have their excuse.

3
00:00:07,087 --> 00:00:08,497
They cut off our water!

4
00:00:08,844 --> 00:00:09,922
Qin Shuang's right.

5
00:00:10,108 --> 00:00:10,908
Water,

6
00:00:10,963 --> 00:00:12,022
we'll find our own.

7
00:00:14,908 --> 00:00:16,926
The deep pool's still got water!

8
00:00:17,256 --> 00:00:18,296
Water's down here,

9
00:00:18,361 --> 00:00:19,307
fields are up there,

10
00:00:19,373 --> 00:00:20,670
can't carry it up.

11
00:00:20,742 --> 00:00:22,290
Say it plain.

12
00:00:22,413 --> 00:00:23,089
Dig wells.

13
00:00:23,159 --> 00:00:24,138
By the fields,

14
00:00:24,192 --> 00:00:25,468
till we hit water.

15
00:00:28,343 --> 00:00:30,185
Three days now,

16
00:00:30,257 --> 00:00:32,979
not one well's hit water.

17
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:34,673
Elder Han, go rest.

18
00:00:35,283 --> 00:00:36,868
Brother Xu, I'll go!

19
00:00:36,943 --> 00:00:38,608
Erniu, my turn.

20
00:00:40,245 --> 00:00:41,614
How long's he been down?

21
00:00:42,362 --> 00:00:44,148
All day.

22
00:00:44,212 --> 00:00:45,032
Pull him up.

23
00:00:47,812 --> 00:00:49,524
No… no water.

24
00:00:51,154 --> 00:00:52,632
Out of the way.

25
00:00:54,902 --> 00:00:56,589
Soft little scholar,

26
00:00:56,653 --> 00:00:57,940
showing off,

27
00:00:57,998 --> 00:00:59,753
digging wells.

28
00:00:59,828 --> 00:01:02,931
Qin Shuang: affection forty-one.

29
00:01:03,016 --> 00:01:04,877
Reward chest opened:

30
00:01:04,948 --> 00:01:07,066
waterwheel blueprint.

31
00:01:07,132 --> 00:01:09,094
Old Shi, can you build this?

32
00:01:09,551 --> 00:01:10,750
Fine drawing.

33
00:01:11,079 --> 00:01:13,059
Three hundred pounds of good wood,

34
00:01:13,135 --> 00:01:14,702
where in this village?

35
00:01:14,764 --> 00:01:16,547
We cut the big trees last year.

36
00:01:17,701 --> 00:01:19,110
Timber that size,

37
00:01:19,172 --> 00:01:20,874
only one left in the village.

38
00:01:21,183 --> 00:01:22,713
The ancestral hall beam.

39
00:01:22,787 --> 00:01:24,762
Ancestors above.

40
00:01:25,254 --> 00:01:27,631
Take down the hall's beam,

41
00:01:27,697 --> 00:01:30,067
to give the children water.

42
00:01:32,686 --> 00:01:34,537
Scholar Xu, you decide.
